{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c07143774df5267ccb98acb41c008969059af706af930f44e1a2f748e7544a64", "ja": "願うことは……", "zh": "许下的愿望是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6945a362382c29c703f3dbe8f7398f5a27b7712c9ccebaf3f05b4fb362576c0", "ja": "気まずい雰囲気の『ジェミニ』のレッスン。\nプロデューサーは桃子と話し、風花の願いと\n桃子の願い、そして他のアイドル達の思いは\n全て同じ……花が無事咲いて、女の子に笑顔\nになって欲しいだけだと語るのだった。", "zh": "气氛尴尬的《Gemini》课程。\n制作人与桃子交谈后说道，风花的愿望、\n桃子的愿望，以及其他偶像们的心愿，\n全都一样……只是希望花朵能顺利绽放，\n让女孩露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "690ba7a1be6890f6e0b1cafb4b37e06c36aab5107befe093252c45bfc02c8adb", "ja": "（今日は、『ジェミニ』のみんなのレッスン日。\n昨日の事も気になるので、様子を見に来たけど……）", "zh": "（今天是《双子座》大家的练习日。因为还很在意昨天的事，所以过来看看情况，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "30a2f83a4096b396e6c418ca5a9de759e6b823ca184f74d36db2317ea4b1f5fc", "ja": "今日のレッスンは、ここまでね。\nふたりとも、帰ったらちゃんとストレッチしてね？", "zh": "今天的练习就到这里吧。\n你们两个回去后要好好做拉伸哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8fbffdc5bea3b6a1a8880c2ac2a34b75cb8d858807d837e86c152c6fea63a29", "ja": "は、はい！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8442a42334266b3793a5c3d69e7700336e75d01f312290df74e7106a0deb580b", "ja": "（ふたりとも、まだぎこちないな。\nとにかく、話をしてみるか……）", "zh": "（两个人还是有些拘谨啊。\n总之，先聊聊看吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "301061fee472ccee4a850596241c0c781f6df0df4300df6aa936ec2837e59504", "ja": "桃子、急に呼び出して悪かったな。ええと……。", "zh": "桃子，突然把你叫来，真是不好意思。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "eb3631405b89a97071af03fcf77e70c67102fa1910b9a4d9375c752a667c4e81", "ja": "ううん、わかってる……今回は桃子が悪いから。\nレッスンの空気、悪くしちゃったし……。", "zh": "不，桃子明白……这次是桃子的错。\n把练习的气氛弄得很糟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "9640c90fc25d676f8078efce3cd22a75f826c080bfc48da84615fcb7c1ef7e50", "ja": "昨日のあれは、風花さんがあの子のためを思って\n言ったんだって、桃子もわかってるよ。でも……。", "zh": "昨天那些话，桃子也知道是风花姐为了那孩子着想才说的。可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eef1625072f3155e17303c03e8bdd61e35bac49763855de577301cf0f574dd74", "ja": "そうか。……桃子も、\nあの子のために考えてたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……桃子也在为那孩子着想啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6a2c024e6ce4d7dfc598fc74f6141cbe33f5709ad94b38505000aa27802a3555", "ja": "一生懸命やって、それでも花が咲かなかったら……\nあの子が、もっと悲しむって思ったのか？", "zh": "你是觉得……要是拼尽全力，最后花还是没能开，\n那孩子会更加难过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "585860ecafb7f860021f440e1979dade77212f076cb3a5d65c06df78584bb845", "ja": "……。だって……絶対なんて言ったら、\nあの子は、お花が咲くって信じちゃうでしょ。", "zh": "……。可是……要是说了“绝对”之类的话，\n那孩子肯定就会坚信花一定会开了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "1641691052587f81f3014c5cb01469ff520547b058ee3a36e5cef8c85777a408", "ja": "でも、相手はお花だから。\n絶対かどうかなんて、誰にもわからないし。", "zh": "可是，对方是花呀。\n到底是不是绝对会开，谁也不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "9bdb4eea0d4e55e5bdc65f3d40785f722da11b94b8a88445f686689ed629de46", "ja": "それに……咲かなかったら、あの子は、\n風花さんがウソをついたって思っちゃう。だから……。", "zh": "而且……要是没能开花，那孩子会觉得风花姐是在说谎。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d14ff88abe79daf8a8a28341217cc796da2ac2ca21f7a0ca670c88d1444a5e8f", "ja": "そうだな。……桃子の言うとおり、\n信じれば必ず叶うなんて、気休めかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。……就像桃子说的那样，\n相信了就一定能实现，或许只是自我安慰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "163ad95932ea41a27146f7bf34acb65c176e7c7e458f28c9eebee6da01046002", "ja": "でも風花は、最後まで信じ続けたいんじゃないかな。\n叶わないかもしれなくても。", "zh": "但风花不是想一直相信到最后吗？\n即使明白愿望也许无法实现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "67ecbdb4aff1236d5e7661a4667683e43f4a8694f5090a73e3126a8546649608", "ja": "叶わないって、わかってるのに信じるの？\n……どうして？", "zh": "明知道实现不了，还要去相信吗？\n……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a12b6a38818a36b4e616c52066f49a94d7462f761337a83e1e5f161e4cac1bc9", "ja": "そうだな。本当の事は、本人にしかわからないけど\n……あの子に、諦めてほしくなかったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊。真正的想法，只有本人自己知道，不过……或许，是不希望那孩子放弃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "af2cf2696f214189e4df3661e5c9f0a5b3b785f70b1e3a418955a3351cabf12f", "ja": "明るい未来を期待する事や、\n苦しい思いの先にある希望を。", "zh": "对光明未来的期待，以及历经痛苦后所迎来的希望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "14b66ee3ec70036d6b58487aac4d23e3a474703964fe6059bb2000b6d287a51e", "ja": "……。\n難しくて、よくわかんない……。", "zh": "……。\n太难了，桃子听不太懂……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8b22dc2657a99c38c5324b9bd9c7965d430969d1040a0eff39a7dcb3153b8257", "ja": "そうか。……とにかく、\n桃子も風花も、同じ結果を望んでるって事だよ。", "zh": "这样啊。……总之，桃子和风花都希望得到同样的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "20ee144ae35c39ab0331ad15e82b8fd9f87d767eb87a62708f0bdddf8eebae3e", "ja": "同じ結果？", "zh": "同一个结果？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ec92844064338f2fc0df672c1ae5bcc9b83acc66cd32093d212db2d670632171", "ja": "うん。花が咲いて、あの子に、\n笑顔になって欲しいって。違うか？", "zh": "嗯。就是希望花朵绽放后，那孩子能露出笑容。不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "320cb429646683dd0b42706b9ab4b055c03bfea1faa8b4abc825f921e778849c", "ja": "……。うん。", "zh": "……。嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "12feabba27e33f3b0414d36b663e3fae182bf79ee54febbfe89eddcbf04d20f2", "ja": "おっ、メールだ……美也からだな。\n花の様子は、昨日と変わらないそうだ。", "zh": "哦，是邮件……美也发来的啊。\n听说花儿的情况和昨天一样，没有变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "79093a83e5e14d91f42af87d4324853d224d90f9e3d0589bd23040e3e8b0c342", "ja": "えっ？　美也さん、花壇に行ってるの？", "zh": "咦？美也小姐去花坛了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b8ce2049001321dc1bdf10cf5033eee6cd2eb362c061c23623bfdf9c9206059f", "ja": "ああ。エミリーと一緒に。『ジェミニ』のみんなは\nレッスンがあるから、その代わりにって。", "zh": "啊。和艾米莉一起去的。因为《双子座》的大家要上课，所以我们就替她们去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "23e3d945b3f6bb74fed509d4a570ed3813b551ebe623c7ee05c86fd9ddb32bc9", "ja": "ふたりも多分同じ気持ちなんだ。\n心配や不安はあるけど、それでも信じてる。", "zh": "她们两个大概也是同样的心情。\n虽然会担心、会不安，但即便如此，还是相信着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd4e2f71f539f864a61fadbebb5e2157eb7fb16f78bb0ca3e5cea0ab770d090c", "ja": "……。そっか。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "914b8860da6b149324737ae84fcdbcb09bea2e0fee93fb02273169a15eeb304d", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、話はもう終わりだよね？\n桃子、帰らなくちゃ。", "zh": "哥哥，话已经说完了吧？\n桃子得回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "89ff8493a6969b698dc7a02257b56d7174b7f4052e97e6d27e20d030b943ad80", "ja": "それと、その…………ありがと。", "zh": "还有那个…………谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1035_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c9efbe8da705ac163f814abc92a1e709d87b08b505f1734a9a234e81ca5ad3f1", "ja": "（……ふたりとも、願う事は同じなんだ。\n桃子と風花、うまく仲直りできるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（……两个人的愿望是一样的。希望桃子和风花能顺利和好就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
